@startuml
title 缩略图预览用例实现顺序图
participant "机主" as P0
participant "MainController" as P1
participant "ImageServiceImpl" as P2
participant "FileUtil/ImageUtil" as P3
participant "ImageDao/DirectoryDao" as P4
participant "PostgreSQL" as P5
P0 -> P1: 在目录树选择文件夹
P1 -> P2: loadImagesFromDirectory(path)
P2 -> P4: findOrCreate(path)
P4 -> P5: INSERT/SELECT directories
P2 -> P3: listImageFiles + generateThumbnail
P2 -> P4: batchInsert(newImages)
P4 -> P5: 写入 images.thumbnail/metadata
P4 -> P2: 返回 ImageFile 列表
P2 -> P1: 返回带ID和缩略图的模型
P1 -> P0: 渲染缩略图网格和状态栏
@enduml
